  <UserdefinedSymbols />
  <Comments>Original v3 testing revision for Steam Batman Arkham City GOTY. Armor Full removed after visual-bug report. Combat activation immediately refreshes streamed enemy classes, invalidates class caches, and restarts a previously paused timer. Runtime Status exposes tick, damage mode, and successful HP edits without output popups; gameplay confirmation still needed. Disable old initializer and restart game before clean test. No console edits. Back up saves. Do not combine trainers. Disable combat modifiers for scripted bosses/interrogations. Teleports do not stream maps or check walls; L undoes, J resaves. Challenge score is an unverified HUD-field test. Applied HP reductions persist until enemies respawn. Batarang damage and challenge features need testing. Hotkeys J/K/L; F1-F4; main keyboard -/=. No armor, fly, combo, XP, upgrade-point, waypoint or scan/story-flag cheats.</Comments>
</CheatTable>